title: Railroads on Strike! 
new-page: true
view-if: vikzhel_unrest >= 50 and vikzhel_strength >= 25 and vikzhel_strike != 1
on-arrival: {!
    Q.vikzhel_strike = 1;
    Q.workers_unrest += 10;
             
  	Q.previous_military_trains = Q.military_trains;
  	Q.previous_civilian_transport = Q.civilian_transport; 
  	Q.previous_transportation_industry = Q.transportation_industry;
  	Q.previous_industry = Q.industry; 
  
  	Q.military_trains *= 0.1;
  	Q.civilian_transport *= 0.5;
  	Q.transportation_industry = 0.5; 
  	Q.industry = Q.previous_industry * 0.5; 
  	Q.ag_transport *= 0.9; 
!}

The All-Russian Union of Railway Workers (**Vikzhel**) has declared that they are launching their promised railroad strike! Railway workers across the country are refusing to work, bringing our industry to a standstill. 
